+Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. Graphics Clock & Reset Controller Binding
+--------------------------------------------------------------------
+
+Required properties :
+- compatible : shall contain "qcom,sdm845-gpucc" or "qcom,msm8998-gpucc",
+		"qcom,sdm845-v2-gpucc"
+		"qcom,lahaina-gpucc",
