+		to be used in aggregation scheme. It is represented as
+		actual util-factor * 100.
+
+Examples:
+
+soc {
+	...
+	system_noc: interconnect@1900000 {
+		reg = <0x1900000 0x8200>;
+		compatible = "qcom,trinket-sys_noc";
+		#interconnect-cells = <1>;
