+Interrupt chips
+---------------
+
+* Intel I/O Advanced Programmable Interrupt Controller (IO APIC)
+
+  Required properties:
+  --------------------
+     compatible = "intel,ce4100-ioapic";
+     #interrupt-cells = <2>;
+
+  Device's interrupt property:
+
+     interrupts = <P S>;
+
+  The first number (P) represents the interrupt pin which is wired to the
+  IO APIC. The second number (S) represents the sense of interrupt which
+  should be configured and can be one of:
+    0 - Edge Rising
+    1 - Level Low
+    2 - Level High
+    3 - Edge Falling
+
+* Local APIC
+  Required property:
+
+     compatible = "intel,ce4100-lapic";
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/vendor/bindings/interrupt-controller/intel,ixp4xx-interrupt.yaml b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/vendor/bindings/interrupt-controller/intel,ixp4xx-interrupt.yaml
