+    These all support nvidia,pull-down-strength, nvidia,pull-up-strength,
+    nvidia,slew-rate-rising, nvidia,slew-rate-falling. Most but not all
+    support nvidia,high-speed-mode, nvidia,schmitt, nvidia,low-power-mode
