+		    specified pins. Functions are only valid for gpio pins.
+		    Valid values are:
+
+		    gpio, adsp_ext, agera_pll, atest_char, atest_tsens,
+		    atest_tsens2, atest_usb1, atest_usb10, atest_usb11,
