+UDA1334 audio CODEC
+
+This device uses simple GPIO pins for controlling codec settings.
+
+Required properties:
+
+  - compatible : "nxp,uda1334"
+  - nxp,mute-gpios: a GPIO spec for the MUTE pin.
+  - nxp,deemph-gpios: a GPIO spec for the De-emphasis pin
+
